    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "pg_control 竞态改成只传一个字段",
      "summary": "Alexander Korotkov 给 pg_control 写入的竞态提了个更简单的解法。问题在于后端进程要在挂上共享内存之前读 pg_control。Thomas Munro 此前提议通过 BackendParameters 传一份原型控制文件副本，被指出有用到过期数值的风险。Korotkov 发现挂共享内存之前真正需要的只有 data_checksum_version 一个字段，补丁便只传这个值，也压低了读到陈旧数据的概率。",
      "url": "https://www.postgresql.org/message-id/CAPpHfdvvPQGT_AST9zrFLZEQX5tDCbAzK6n6jpqprbrpNzk3Mg@mail.gmail.com",
      "author": "Alexander Korotkov",
      "source": "pgsql-hackers 邮件列表",
      "source_date": "2026-05-06",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "pg_control",
        "竞态"
      ],
      "position": 3
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "PostgreSQL 19 把 MultiXact 成员扩到 64 位",
      "summary": "PostgreSQL 19 把 MultiXactOffset 从 32 位扩到 64 位，pg_upgrade 时会自动重写 pg_multixact/offsets，生产规模的集群可能要几分钟。这消掉了一类紧急事故：MultiXactId 还有余量、成员空间却先耗尽，报 multixact members limit exceeded，逼着在写入高峰做紧急 vacuum。外键密集的多租户系统受益最大。",
      "url": "https://thebuild.com/blog/multixact-members-at-64-bits-one-less-wraparound-to-worry-about/",
      "author": "Christophe Pettus",
      "source": "thebuild.com",
      "source_date": "2026-05-06",
      "image": "https://thebuild.com/media/media/a353d6d9c6e34560ae1627bc1d01afc8.png",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "MultiXact",
        "回卷",
        "PostgreSQL 19"
      ],
      "position": 4
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "用顾问锁替代可序列化隔离来做保留归档",
      "summary": "Yugabyte 的 Mark Peacock 写了一种用 PostgreSQL 顾问锁替代可序列化隔离来防写偏斜的做法，场景是按保留期归档清理数据。传统做法靠分区管理来做保留清理，代价是分区维护的开销；改用顾问锁之后写入性能可预测，清理过程也更好控制。他把这归为数据建模层面的方案：既保住一致性，又不用背分区管理的复杂度，适合保留策略严格、写吞吐又高的应用。",
      "url": "https://www.yugabyte.com/blog/advisory-locking-serializable-isolation-and-retention-archiving/",
      "author": "Mark Peacock",
      "source": "Yugabyte 博客",
      "source_date": "2026-05-06",
      "image": "https://www.yugabyte.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/advisory-locking-serializable-isolation-and-retention-archiving-blog-social.jpg",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "顾问锁",
        "隔离级别",
        "归档"
      ],
      "position": 5
